OL,3,AThe shake-up facing renters as a new
OL,4,Akind of landlord emerges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shake-up facing renters as a new
OL,7,Fkind of landlord emerges
OL,9,FOn Christmas Eve 2021, there was a
OL,10,Fknock on the door of Lexi Levens'
OL,11,Frented flat. It was a letter sent by
OL,12,Fspecial delivery from the NHS nurse's
OL,13,Flandlord saying she, her husband, and
OL,14,Ffour children had two months to move
OL,15,Fout.
OL,17,F"The kids all thought it was a present
OL,18,Farriving," she recalls.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
